name memoize
category Package
revision 70015
shortdesc Externalization of graphics and memoization of compilation results in general
longdesc Memoize is a package for externalization of graphics and
longdesc memoization of compilation results in general, allowing the
longdesc author to reuse the results of compilation-intensive code.
longdesc Memoize (i) induces very little overhead, as all externalized
longdesc graphics is produced in a single compilation. It features (ii)
longdesc automatic recompilation upon the change of code or
longdesc user-adjustable context, and (iii) automatic externalization of
longdesc TikZ pictures and Forest trees, easily extensible to other
longdesc commands and environments. Furthermore, Memoize (iv) supports
longdesc cross-referencing, TikZ overlays and Beamer, (v) works with all
longdesc major engines and formats, and (vi) is adaptable to any
longdesc workflow.
depend memoize.ARCH
runfiles size=60
 texmf-dist/scripts/memoize/memoize-clean.pl
 texmf-dist/scripts/memoize/memoize-clean.py
 texmf-dist/scripts/memoize/memoize-extract.pl
 texmf-dist/scripts/memoize/memoize-extract.py
 texmf-dist/tex/context/third/memoize/t-memoizable.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/context/third/memoize/t-memoize.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/context/third/memoize/t-nomemoize.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/generic/memoize/memoizable.code.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/latex/memoize/memoizable.sty
 texmf-dist/tex/latex/memoize/memoize.sty
 texmf-dist/tex/latex/memoize/nomemoize.sty
 texmf-dist/tex/plain/memoize/memoizable.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/plain/memoize/memoize-extract-one.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/plain/memoize/memoize.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/plain/memoize/nomemoize.tex
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/sasozivanovic/memoize
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/memoize
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics compilation ext-code cond-comp macro-gen graphics
catalogue-version 1.1.2
